<section class="hp hp-selection" id="hp-selection" aria-labelledby="hp-selection-title-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="hp-shell hp-selection__shell">
    <div class="hp-selection__heading">
      <div>
        <p class="hp-selection__kicker"><span class="hp-selection__spark" aria-hidden="true"></span> THOUGHTFUL FINDS. REAL LIFE.</p>
        <h2 id="hp-selection-title-{{ section.id }}">The idea catches your eye.<br><em>The details win your confidence.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="hp-selection__intro">
        <p>It's easy to love an idea in a short video. What's harder is knowing if it really belongs in your life. We want that second part to feel natural—with the story behind a find and the practical answers close at hand.</p>
        <a href="/pages/about" class="hp-selection__link">See what matters to us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hp-selection__cards" role="list">
      <article class="hp-selection__card" role="listitem">
        <span class="hp-selection__number" aria-hidden="true">01 / RECOGNIZE</span>
        <div class="hp-selection__symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</div>
        <h3>You've felt that before.</h3>
        <p>The tiny inconvenience you work around every day. The task you wish took less effort. Good ideas begin with moments you recognize.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="hp-selection__card" role="listitem">
        <span class="hp-selection__number" aria-hidden="true">02 / IMAGINE</span>
        <div class="hp-selection__symbol" aria-hidden="true">◈</div>
        <h3>Picture the better moment.</h3>
        <p>An everyday task made a little simpler. A space that feels easier to use. The possibility is exciting—but it still needs to fit your life.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="hp-selection__card" role="listitem">
        <span class="hp-selection__number" aria-hidden="true">03 / FEEL SURE</span>
        <div class="hp-selection__symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
        <h3>Know before you choose.</h3>
        <p>What it is, how it's intended to work, what's included, and what happens after an order. Clear answers help a choice feel like your own.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    {% if settings.hp_store_preparation %}
      <div class="hp-selection__status"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span><strong>Something thoughtful is taking shape.</strong> Our first find isn't available to order yet. <a href="/pages/contact">Curious? We'd love to hear from you.</a></div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{% stylesheet %}
.hp-selection { background:#102139; color:#ffffff; padding:clamp(68px,8vw,110px) 0 0; overflow:hidden; }
.hp-selection__heading { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr 0.8fr; gap:clamp(36px,7vw,110px); align-items:end; padding-bottom:58px; }
.hp-selection__kicker { margin:0 0 28px; color:#a5d5cf; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.18em; }
.hp-selection__spark { display:inline-block; background:#9dd7cb; height:8px; width:8px; transform:rotate(45deg); margin-right:12px; }
.hp-selection h2 { font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,84px); line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.065em; font-weight:650; }
.hp-selection h2 em { font-style:normal; color:#9dd7cb; }
.hp-selection__intro p { line-height:1.8; font-size:clamp(15px,1.3vw,18px); color:#d0dde2; max-width:46ch; }
.hp-selection__link { display:inline-flex; gap:18px; align-items:center; padding:12px 0; margin-top:20px; color:white; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; border-bottom:1px solid #709397; text-decoration:none; }
.hp-selection__link:hover { color:#9dd7cb; }
.hp-selection__cards { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); border-top:1px solid #4d6972; }
.hp-selection__card { padding:40px 32px 56px; border-left:1px solid #4d6972; display:flex; flex-direction:column; min-width:0; }
.hp-selection__card:first-child { border-left:0; padding-left:0; }
.hp-selection__number { font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.15em; color:#b6c9d0; font-weight:700; }
.hp-selection__symbol { display:grid; place-items:center; width:58px; height:58px; border:1px solid #55747c; border-radius:18px; font-size:28px; color:#9dd7cb; margin:40px 0; }
.hp-selection__card h3 { color:#fff; font-size:clamp(22px,2vw,31px); font-weight:650; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
.hp-selection__card p { font-size:14px; line-height:1.8; color:#b7cad0; margin-top:14px; max-width:37ch; }
.hp-selection__status { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:baseline; flex-wrap:wrap; padding:20px 0; border-top:1px solid #4d6972; color:#cedee1; font-size:13px; }
.hp-selection__status strong { color:#fff; }
.hp-selection__status > span { color:#9dd7cb; font-size:11px; }
.hp-selection__status a { color:#a1dfd3; text-underline-offset:3px; }
@media(max-width:749px) {
  .hp-selection { padding-top:64px; }
  .hp-selection__heading { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:23px; padding-bottom:38px; }
  .hp-selection h2 { font-size:clamp(46px,11vw,70px); }
  .hp-selection__kicker { margin-bottom:20px; }
  .hp-selection__cards { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .hp-selection__card, .hp-selection__card:first-child { border:0; border-top:1px solid #4d6972; padding:26px 0 32px; }
  .hp-selection__card:first-child { border-top:0; }
  .hp-selection__symbol { margin:22px 0; height:48px; width:48px; font-size:24px; border-radius:13px; }
  .hp-selection__card h3 { font-size:26px; }
}
{% endstylesheet %}
{% schema %}
{"name":"HiParcelo: Our standard","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"HiParcelo: Our standard"}]}
{% endschema %}
